      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stella_Rimington",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2a9a6b59690cbcd5\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n<strong>Dame Stella Rimington</strong> (née Whitehouse; 13 May 1935 – 3 August 2025) was a British author and Director General of MI5, a position she held from 1992 to 1996. She was the first female Director General of MI5, and the first Director General whose name was publicised on appointment.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2a9a6b59690cbcd5\">>>",
