      "url": "https://thebookerprizes.com/the-booker-library/judges/stella-rimington",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"70410b612338b6c9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nShe held the Director General position at MI5 from 1992-96 and was not only the domestic counter-intelligence and security agency’s first female DG, but the first whose name was publicised on appointment. Rimington retired from MI5 in 1996, and was then a non-executive director for companies such as Marks &amp; Spencer and BG Group.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"70410b612338b6c9\">>>",
